WEBVTT

01:30.510 --> 01:34.940
[The Heir]

01:35.370 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 41]

01:38.870 --> 01:39.870
Master Luo,

01:42.039 --> 01:43.590
I asked you to stay

01:44.420 --> 01:46.080
because I wanted to talk to you

01:49.000 --> 01:50.400
about you and Zhen.

01:55.530 --> 01:56.570
Our Zhen

01:57.400 --> 01:59.130
seems reserved on the surface,

01:59.400 --> 02:01.230
but in front of her mother and me,

02:02.120 --> 02:03.920
she can't hide anything.

02:05.120 --> 02:06.760
We can all see that for the

02:07.480 --> 02:08.470
past 3 years,

02:09.470 --> 02:10.630
this girl

02:10.840 --> 02:13.170
hasn't been able
to let you go for a moment.

02:14.630 --> 02:15.590
However,

02:16.680 --> 02:18.810
because she's the pillar of the house,

02:19.190 --> 02:20.430
she doesn't dare

02:20.870 --> 02:22.680
take a step forward easily.

02:25.240 --> 02:26.430
If you

02:26.710 --> 02:28.079
can't let her go either,

02:28.470 --> 02:30.310
you should take the first step.

02:31.960 --> 02:32.870
Is that okay?

02:33.310 --> 02:34.310
Eighth Master Li,

02:35.280 --> 02:38.540
I haven't forgotten Li Zhen for a moment
in the past 3 years.

02:39.150 --> 02:39.870
But...

02:41.870 --> 02:42.910
now I

02:43.680 --> 02:46.740
don't dare have any
inappropriate thoughts about her.

02:48.800 --> 02:49.800
Eighth Master Li,

02:50.800 --> 02:52.560
3 years ago, I learned that

02:53.400 --> 02:55.660
it was my father who ruined the Li family,

02:55.870 --> 02:57.120
ruined Li Ink,

02:57.520 --> 02:58.590
and ruined you.

03:01.840 --> 03:03.080
Today, I...

03:04.840 --> 03:06.770
dare not ask for your forgiveness.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.240
I only ask that you

03:09.910 --> 03:11.150
accept my bow.

03:13.520 --> 03:14.310
Master Luo.

03:15.120 --> 03:16.360
Please get up.

03:22.280 --> 03:24.120
How old were you back then?

03:25.630 --> 03:27.800
Just a child around Zhen's age.

03:31.280 --> 03:32.340
No matter how great

03:33.630 --> 03:35.160
the Luo family's sins were,

03:35.630 --> 03:37.280
they cannot be blamed on you.

03:37.840 --> 03:39.440
Thank you, Eighth Master Li.

03:42.910 --> 03:43.800
But...

03:45.280 --> 03:46.880
fate plays tricks on people.

03:48.030 --> 03:49.680
This must be my destiny.

03:50.800 --> 03:52.430
Fate does play tricks.

03:53.750 --> 03:55.150
Indeed.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.190
I'll go call Li Zhen back.

04:01.190 --> 04:01.960
Come back!

04:07.910 --> 04:09.080
This is

04:10.310 --> 04:12.800
the crucial stage for the Liuhe Ink.

04:13.590 --> 04:15.120
If you tell her,

04:15.520 --> 04:17.180
and her mind gets distracted,

04:17.360 --> 04:18.269
can she keep

04:19.160 --> 04:20.390
making this ink?

04:20.950 --> 04:21.750
My illness

04:21.950 --> 04:23.040
can't be cured.

04:35.920 --> 04:37.320
At this critical moment,

04:38.480 --> 04:39.950
my current condition

04:40.430 --> 04:42.090
should be kept confidential.

04:43.560 --> 04:44.720
Only you

04:45.270 --> 04:46.040
and I know.

04:49.800 --> 04:50.330
Alright.

04:54.120 --> 04:55.120
Eighth Master Li.

04:58.270 --> 04:59.560
I trust you.

05:06.550 --> 05:14.590
[Li Ink]

05:11.040 --> 05:11.870
Zhen,

05:12.600 --> 05:14.070
I will make this piece

05:14.800 --> 05:15.680
of Liuhe Ink

05:16.680 --> 05:17.950
with you.

05:19.390 --> 05:20.320
Grandfather...

05:21.000 --> 05:21.750
Jinshui.

05:22.500 --> 05:23.100
Jinshui.

05:25.040 --> 05:26.120
Think carefully.

05:26.560 --> 05:30.160
You made a Teeth-etched Oath
before the Founder's Black Banner.

05:30.310 --> 05:31.680
If you touch ink now,

05:32.310 --> 05:33.370
wouldn't that mean

05:33.750 --> 05:35.280
you're breaking your oath?

05:39.480 --> 05:40.630
Third Master Chen.

05:41.360 --> 05:44.820
I, Li Jinshui, have been obsessed
with ink-making all my life.

05:45.120 --> 05:46.510
If I am lucky enough

05:46.610 --> 05:48.210
to see the Liuhe Ink's birth,

05:48.560 --> 05:50.920
what does it matter if I break my oath?

05:54.870 --> 05:58.120
I've taught our Zhen
to make ink for so many years,

05:59.480 --> 06:01.360
but I've never made ink with her.

06:09.360 --> 06:10.270
Zhen,

06:10.800 --> 06:12.070
today,

06:12.920 --> 06:15.120
we, as grandfather and granddaughter,
will work together.

06:15.120 --> 06:15.870
Okay.

06:16.680 --> 06:18.540
I'll listen to you, Grandfather.

06:23.390 --> 06:24.360
Mix the ink!

06:25.310 --> 06:28.040
Mix the ink!

06:28.270 --> 06:28.950
Wenqian!

06:30.920 --> 06:32.000
Pour in the lampblack.

06:32.000 --> 06:32.510
Okay.

06:46.270 --> 06:47.670
Eighth Master Li, you...

06:49.830 --> 06:50.390
Okay.

06:53.240 --> 06:54.040
Grandfather.

07:10.480 --> 07:11.270
Turn up the fire.

07:11.270 --> 07:11.870
Got it.

07:29.720 --> 07:30.510
Second mix!

07:30.750 --> 07:31.390
Wenqian!

07:32.159 --> 07:33.420
Pour in the lampblack.

07:36.310 --> 07:37.370
Add some more glue.

08:06.240 --> 08:07.160
Third mix.

08:07.390 --> 08:08.160
Wenqian,

08:08.180 --> 08:09.340
add more lampblack.

08:09.470 --> 08:10.110
Okay.

08:13.240 --> 08:15.240
Add jade powder and musk.

08:43.840 --> 08:44.550
Wenqian,

08:44.870 --> 08:45.720
add borneol.

09:25.840 --> 09:26.960
Fourth mix!

09:27.390 --> 09:28.030
Wenqian,

09:28.720 --> 09:29.580
add lampblack.

09:41.200 --> 09:42.630
Eighth Master Li, let me do it.

09:42.630 --> 09:43.430
Grandfather,

09:43.720 --> 09:45.080
why don't you rest for a while?

09:45.080 --> 09:46.480
Leave this to us.

09:47.510 --> 09:48.170
Have a seat.

09:49.200 --> 09:49.750
Come.

09:55.320 --> 09:55.780
Come on.

09:55.790 --> 09:56.320
Come on.

10:30.840 --> 10:31.640
Grandfather,

10:32.150 --> 10:33.240
the fourth mix...

10:33.720 --> 10:35.600
Why aren't the ink and glue mixing?

10:35.600 --> 10:37.270
If it were really that easy,

10:38.200 --> 10:40.870
someone would have tried it long ago.

10:42.150 --> 10:43.390
Pour this out.

10:44.910 --> 10:46.080
Adjust

10:46.750 --> 10:48.270
the materials and glue mixture again.

10:48.270 --> 10:49.270
Let's start over.

10:49.390 --> 10:50.080
Okay.

10:52.120 --> 10:53.000
Start over!

10:53.030 --> 10:56.030
[Ink Workshop]

11:12.440 --> 11:13.510
Fourth mix!

11:14.360 --> 11:15.440
Add lampblack!

11:15.550 --> 11:16.680
It's the fourth mix.

11:17.670 --> 11:19.030
Fourth mix!

11:25.000 --> 11:25.840
Continue.

11:27.790 --> 11:28.390
Come on.

11:39.000 --> 11:39.870
Add the materials.

11:39.870 --> 11:40.360
Okay.

12:10.390 --> 12:11.360
Fifth mix!

12:11.790 --> 12:12.790
Okay! Come on!

12:12.790 --> 12:13.910
Add lampblack!

12:15.390 --> 12:16.270
Fifth mix!

12:21.320 --> 12:21.840
Come on!

12:30.960 --> 12:31.750
Rotate it.

12:32.630 --> 12:33.480
Add the materials!

12:33.480 --> 12:35.030
Come on. Add it.

13:03.390 --> 13:04.320
Wenqian.

13:05.720 --> 13:07.480
Take a rest. I'll take over.

13:17.390 --> 13:21.600
-Sixth mix!
-Sixth mix!

13:21.600 --> 13:22.320
Come on!

13:22.320 --> 13:24.200
-Sixth mix!
-Sixth mix!

13:24.510 --> 13:25.550
Add lampblack!

13:25.750 --> 13:26.390
Come on.

13:26.750 --> 13:27.630
Add it.

13:37.790 --> 13:38.440
Come on!

13:38.850 --> 13:39.520
Keep going!

13:39.550 --> 13:40.270
Keep going!

13:41.390 --> 13:42.320
Harder!

13:49.750 --> 13:51.320
Tianhe!

13:51.550 --> 13:52.510
Heaven aligns!

13:53.320 --> 13:54.480
Earth aligns!

13:54.910 --> 13:55.790
Earth aligns!

13:56.000 --> 13:57.120
Human aligns!

13:57.840 --> 13:58.840
Human aligns!

14:00.240 --> 14:01.300
Technique aligns.

14:01.630 --> 14:02.690
Technique aligns!

14:03.200 --> 14:04.080
Dao aligns!

14:04.960 --> 14:05.720
Dao aligns!

14:36.440 --> 14:37.080
Again.

14:38.270 --> 14:39.150
Again!

14:39.390 --> 14:40.000
Come on!

14:43.600 --> 14:44.550
Zhen.

14:51.480 --> 14:52.480
Zhen.

14:52.600 --> 14:54.080
We can do this!

14:54.360 --> 14:55.270
Again!

14:56.750 --> 14:57.750
Again!

14:59.080 --> 15:00.000
Again!

15:00.750 --> 15:01.720
Again!

15:03.960 --> 15:04.720
Come on!

15:08.360 --> 15:09.270
Zhen.

15:12.550 --> 15:13.600
Zhen!

15:19.270 --> 15:20.070
Eighth Uncle!

15:20.630 --> 15:21.270
Eighth Master Li!

15:21.270 --> 15:22.630
-Grandfather.
-Eighth Master Li!

15:22.630 --> 15:23.440
-Jinshui!
-Grandfather!

15:23.440 --> 15:24.630
Eighth Master Li! Eighth Master Li!

15:24.630 --> 15:25.510
Grandfather!

15:26.080 --> 15:26.670
Hurry!

15:27.200 --> 15:27.840
Let's go!

15:31.910 --> 15:32.840
One more sip.

15:36.670 --> 15:38.480
You scared me to death just now.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.390
Grandfather,

15:40.600 --> 15:42.080
let me take you back.

15:42.480 --> 15:43.030
The ink is important.

15:43.030 --> 15:44.870
But your health is also important.

15:44.870 --> 15:45.790
We are here.

15:45.790 --> 15:46.910
Don't worry.

15:50.440 --> 15:52.240
I'm sorry for scaring everyone.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.600
I'm fine.

16:02.670 --> 16:03.720
Uncles,

16:04.120 --> 16:05.250
please go out first.

16:05.270 --> 16:06.630
Leave it to us.

16:07.080 --> 16:07.550
Right.

16:07.550 --> 16:08.910
Okay, let's go then.

16:09.510 --> 16:10.240
Don't worry.

16:13.550 --> 16:14.750
Rest well.

16:20.510 --> 16:21.390
Zhen,

16:22.320 --> 16:24.050
I'll be fine after a short rest.

16:24.390 --> 16:26.590
You are the chief ink maker of Liuhe Ink.

16:27.600 --> 16:29.030
You can't just leave.

16:29.270 --> 16:29.960
Go now.

16:30.510 --> 16:31.510
Eighth Master Li,

16:31.670 --> 16:32.530
how about this?

16:32.670 --> 16:33.870
I'll stay here with you.

16:33.870 --> 16:35.670
You don't need to worry about me.

16:35.910 --> 16:36.770
Both of you, go.

16:37.720 --> 16:38.480
Go.

16:40.960 --> 16:41.560
Doggie.

16:41.940 --> 16:43.790
Please take care of my grandfather.

16:43.790 --> 16:44.440
Yes.

16:49.240 --> 16:49.910
Go on.

16:50.030 --> 16:50.630
Let's go.

16:57.630 --> 16:58.630
Keep going!

16:59.550 --> 17:00.120
Okay!

17:00.670 --> 17:01.670
Eighth Master Li.

17:04.829 --> 17:05.750
Lie down for a while.

17:05.750 --> 17:06.400
Alright?

17:07.349 --> 17:07.920
Here.

17:16.550 --> 17:17.880
Here, Eighth Master Li.

17:33.680 --> 17:34.880
Get some rest.

17:35.440 --> 17:36.370
Call me anytime.

17:36.640 --> 17:37.900
I'll be right outside.

18:03.040 --> 18:05.460
[Young Li Jinshui]

18:08.440 --> 18:09.310
Jingqi,

18:09.480 --> 18:11.550
what does it mean
to forge a sword with blood?

18:11.550 --> 18:14.000
It's just a rumor recorded in books.

18:14.350 --> 18:15.680
In my opinion,

18:15.920 --> 18:17.160
using blood as an initiator

18:17.160 --> 18:20.160
represents the determination
to make a good piece of ink.

18:20.160 --> 18:21.020
Think about it.

18:21.400 --> 18:24.400
[Young Li Jintai]

18:21.480 --> 18:23.240
With the determination
to die for something,

18:23.240 --> 18:24.840
what can't be accomplished?

18:27.070 --> 18:27.830
But

18:27.880 --> 18:29.400
since the book says so,

18:29.510 --> 18:31.000
there must be a reason.

18:31.240 --> 18:32.550
When I grow up,

18:31.370 --> 18:34.270
[Young Wang Rujun]

18:32.920 --> 18:34.750
I will try all these anecdotes
from the book

18:34.750 --> 18:35.820
one by one.

18:36.030 --> 18:36.960
Maybe I can make

18:37.030 --> 18:38.720
the best piece of ink in the world

18:38.720 --> 18:40.550
for our Li Ink.

18:43.550 --> 18:44.720
Well said, Eighth Brother.

18:44.720 --> 18:45.440
In the future,

18:45.440 --> 18:47.680
our Li Ink will have to depend on you.

18:53.890 --> 18:54.820
Eighth Brother.

18:55.830 --> 18:56.760
Eighth Brother.

18:59.400 --> 19:00.350
Rujun?

19:00.690 --> 19:01.550
Jingqi?

19:01.020 --> 19:03.860
[Middle-aged Li Jintai]

19:02.000 --> 19:02.930
Eighth Brother,

19:03.400 --> 19:04.540
it's not your fault.

19:04.830 --> 19:07.200
Leave the rest to the descendants.

19:07.830 --> 19:10.920
They will surely forge their own path.

19:11.550 --> 19:12.480
Eighth Brother,

19:13.350 --> 19:14.510
come with me.

19:34.480 --> 19:35.240
Jingqi.

19:35.240 --> 19:36.240
Forging a sword with blood?

19:36.240 --> 19:37.200
Give me some time.

19:37.200 --> 19:38.200
Using blood as an initiator.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.440
Just give me some time.

19:39.440 --> 19:40.440
I beg you,

19:40.640 --> 19:41.880
give me some time.

19:46.510 --> 19:48.110
Using blood as an initiator?

20:05.160 --> 20:06.000
Zhen,

20:06.160 --> 20:07.550
take a break.

20:07.750 --> 20:09.480
Let's make another plan, okay?

20:09.720 --> 20:11.850
-Eighth Master Li?
-Eighth Master Li.

20:12.310 --> 20:14.440
-Eighth Master Li.
-Eighth Master Li.

20:16.920 --> 20:17.720
Grandfather.

20:34.920 --> 20:35.590
Eighth Uncle!

20:35.590 --> 20:36.480
What are you doing?

20:36.480 --> 20:37.270
-Eighth Master Li!
--Eighth Master Li!

20:37.270 --> 20:37.960
Grandfather!

20:37.960 --> 20:38.830
Grandfather, what are you doing?

20:38.830 --> 20:39.920
Don't touch me!

20:40.480 --> 20:41.280
Grandfather!

20:44.720 --> 20:46.310
What are you doing?

20:49.200 --> 20:50.200
In ancient times,

20:51.350 --> 20:53.640
the couple Gan Jiang and Mo Ye

20:54.960 --> 20:56.760
used their blood as an initiator

20:57.140 --> 20:58.830
and their bodies to cast a sword.

20:58.830 --> 21:00.350
That's an ancient legend,

21:00.370 --> 21:01.720
not to be believed.

21:01.720 --> 21:04.070
Human blood has a coagulating effect.

21:05.550 --> 21:06.880
It might be worth trying

21:07.270 --> 21:08.350
in ink-making.

21:09.750 --> 21:10.750
Ink like this—

21:11.030 --> 21:12.490
I would rather not make it!

21:12.880 --> 21:14.030
All my life,

21:14.590 --> 21:16.750
I have never believed in ghosts or gods,

21:16.750 --> 21:17.790
only in myself.

21:20.510 --> 21:22.510
If I don't see the birth of Liuhe Ink,

21:23.240 --> 21:25.790
how can I face Jingqi and Rujun?

21:33.240 --> 21:34.110
Zhen,

21:36.280 --> 21:37.910
I must try it.

21:56.510 --> 21:58.240
Using blood as an initiator...

21:59.790 --> 22:01.350
to give the ink its soul.

22:03.310 --> 22:04.550
Sixth Mix!

22:05.160 --> 22:06.350
Mix the ink!

22:08.330 --> 22:09.680
-Eighth Master Li!
-Eighth Master Li!

22:09.680 --> 22:10.350
Mix the ink!

22:11.410 --> 22:12.410
Come on. Hurry.

22:12.600 --> 22:13.330
Take a break.

22:26.920 --> 22:28.720
Heaven aligns!

22:29.050 --> 22:31.400
Heaven aligns!

22:31.480 --> 22:32.790
Earth aligns!

22:32.920 --> 22:35.030
Earth aligns!

22:35.310 --> 22:36.510
Human aligns!

22:36.790 --> 22:38.590
Human aligns!

22:39.070 --> 22:40.160
Technique aligns!

22:40.240 --> 22:41.680
Technique aligns!

22:41.750 --> 22:42.790
Dao aligns!

22:43.070 --> 22:44.240
Dao aligns!

22:44.510 --> 22:45.680
Heart aligns!

22:45.750 --> 22:47.030
Heart blends.

22:47.030 --> 22:47.890
Heaven blends.

22:47.960 --> 22:49.030
Heaven aligns!

22:49.030 --> 22:49.920
Earth aligns!

22:49.960 --> 22:51.000
Earth aligns!

22:51.000 --> 22:51.920
Human aligns!

22:51.960 --> 22:53.070
Human aligns!

23:36.070 --> 23:37.310
Sixfold alignment!

23:38.920 --> 23:40.310
The ink is done!

23:40.400 --> 23:41.270
It's done!

23:41.630 --> 23:42.030
Eighth Master Li.

23:42.030 --> 23:42.680
It's done!

24:07.270 --> 24:08.530
Sixfold alignment...

24:10.200 --> 24:11.200
It's done.

24:12.070 --> 24:12.790
It's done.

24:17.110 --> 24:17.920
It's done.

24:19.830 --> 24:22.000
-Eighth Master Li?
-Eighth Master Li!

24:22.000 --> 24:23.640
-Eighth Master Li!
-Grandfather!

24:23.640 --> 24:25.370
-Eighth Uncle!
-Grandfather!

24:26.640 --> 24:27.510
Doctor!

24:27.680 --> 24:28.830
Quick, get a doctor!

24:28.830 --> 24:29.310
Hurry!

24:30.030 --> 24:31.350
Grandfather, don't scare me.

24:31.350 --> 24:31.880
Hurry!

24:31.880 --> 24:32.750
Grandfather!

24:33.790 --> 24:34.880
Grandfather!

24:58.270 --> 24:59.310
Grandfather said

25:02.000 --> 25:04.000
he wants to go to the ancestral hall.

25:33.680 --> 25:34.510
Grandfather,

25:35.510 --> 25:36.880
Liuhe Ink is complete.

25:41.720 --> 25:42.680
Zhen.

25:45.510 --> 25:49.200
I want to be alone with you for a while.

25:50.270 --> 25:50.960
Alright.

25:51.510 --> 25:52.270
Alright.

25:56.550 --> 25:58.080
Everyone, please leave us.

26:12.350 --> 26:14.030
Offer incense

26:14.960 --> 26:16.230
on my behalf.

26:18.510 --> 26:19.400
Okay.

26:43.720 --> 26:45.680
Ancestors,

26:50.440 --> 26:51.590
Jinhe,

26:52.480 --> 26:53.680
Jingqi,

26:54.720 --> 26:56.000
Rujun,

26:57.000 --> 26:58.270
I

26:58.790 --> 27:00.070
and Zhen

27:01.170 --> 27:02.970
have brought the ink here.

27:31.640 --> 27:32.590
Grandfather,

27:34.150 --> 27:36.450
Sixth Grandfather, Seventh Grandfather,

27:36.450 --> 27:38.500
and Seventh Grandmother in heaven

27:39.480 --> 27:40.810
will definitely see it.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.790
Rest assured.

27:43.480 --> 27:44.550
Zhen,

27:46.240 --> 27:47.160
don't cry.

27:51.680 --> 27:52.440
I won't.

27:54.880 --> 27:56.350
My Zhen

27:58.880 --> 27:59.960
is smart,

28:01.030 --> 28:02.200
eager to learn,

28:05.590 --> 28:06.830
and diligent.

28:08.750 --> 28:10.440
But I have never

28:12.960 --> 28:15.640
properly praised you all these years.

28:17.880 --> 28:20.550
Instead, I often scolded you

28:22.240 --> 28:24.000
and stood against you

28:24.680 --> 28:26.590
for the Li family.

28:30.110 --> 28:31.550
I'm sorry, Zhen.

28:32.000 --> 28:33.160
No, Grandfather.

28:33.750 --> 28:35.160
I know

28:35.640 --> 28:37.270
you did it for my own good.

28:37.830 --> 28:39.350
I understand.

28:45.880 --> 28:47.270
Actually,

28:49.030 --> 28:51.350
I have always wanted to tell you

28:54.110 --> 28:55.310
that my Zhen

28:57.590 --> 28:59.400
has always been the best.

29:02.350 --> 29:05.070
You've never let me down,

29:07.680 --> 29:09.960
and you've always been my pride.

29:17.680 --> 29:18.790
I

29:22.550 --> 29:24.750
just can't bear to leave you.

30:07.030 --> 30:08.350
Grandfather!

30:09.030 --> 30:10.550
Grandfather!

30:11.100 --> 30:12.470
Grandfather!

30:16.000 --> 30:17.030
Grandfather!

31:34.900 --> 31:36.700
Farewell, Eighth Master Li!

31:39.550 --> 31:42.110
Liuhe Ink is complete!

31:43.480 --> 31:46.070
Farewell, Eighth Master Li!

31:47.600 --> 31:50.400
Liuhe Ink is complete!

31:51.030 --> 31:53.750
Farewell, Eighth Master Li!

31:56.010 --> 31:58.360
Liuhe Ink is complete!

31:59.000 --> 32:01.510
Farewell, Eighth Master Li!

32:03.310 --> 32:06.110
Liuhe Ink is complete!

32:06.550 --> 32:09.350
Farewell, Eighth Master Li!

32:48.550 --> 32:51.160
Lift the coffin!

34:24.320 --> 34:25.480
When I was young,

34:26.400 --> 34:28.030
the Eighth Branch
was expelled from the clan,

34:28.030 --> 34:29.830
and my father passed away early.

34:30.070 --> 34:32.880
Only my grandfather struggled
to support our family

34:32.880 --> 34:34.960
and raised me.

34:36.030 --> 34:37.889
Later, when I started making ink,

34:38.230 --> 34:39.630
he was both an elder

34:40.280 --> 34:41.739
and a strict teacher to me.

34:42.880 --> 34:44.190
If it weren't for him,

34:45.150 --> 34:48.000
I wouldn't have made it to this day

34:48.920 --> 34:51.630
or achieved what I have today.

34:52.440 --> 34:54.570
You dedicated your life to making ink,

34:55.150 --> 34:57.630
ranking first among
the Five Ink-making Grandmasters.

34:57.630 --> 34:59.240
When the Tribute Ink case occurred,

34:59.240 --> 35:01.640
you left Li Ink with unyielding integrity.

35:01.960 --> 35:03.530
Later, you made a Teeth-etched Oath

35:03.530 --> 35:05.090
to never touch ink again.

35:05.440 --> 35:06.880
Up until this very day,

35:07.440 --> 35:08.760
you gave your all for our family,
our country,

35:08.760 --> 35:11.190
and the entire Huizhou ink industry,

35:11.190 --> 35:12.800
dedicating yourself
until your last breath.

35:12.800 --> 35:14.460
Throughout your entire life,

35:14.630 --> 35:15.920
you never lost

35:16.030 --> 35:18.030
your pride as an ink-maker.

35:19.400 --> 35:20.360
Today,

35:20.710 --> 35:23.070
before your coffin, I make this vow—

35:23.960 --> 35:26.630
I wish only to follow in your footsteps
all my life,

35:26.630 --> 35:28.000
to revive our family's legacy,

35:28.000 --> 35:31.440
and to carry forward Li Ink and Hui Ink
to their fullest glory!

35:47.670 --> 35:49.030
Lift the coffin!

35:49.230 --> 35:51.710
Farewell, Eighth Master Li!

35:51.960 --> 35:54.070
Farewell, Eighth Master Li!

35:54.230 --> 35:55.960
Farewell, Eighth Master Li!

35:56.150 --> 35:58.000
Farewell, Eighth Master Li!

36:14.590 --> 36:16.280
Hang the portrait!

36:26.680 --> 36:30.430
Enter the ancestral hall!

36:30.750 --> 36:38.050
[Spirit Tablet of Jinshui,
Son of the Li Family in Ming]

36:45.230 --> 36:47.880
Present the ink for painting!

37:56.880 --> 37:57.840
Your Highness.

37:58.150 --> 37:59.670
The Li family's Liuhe Ink

37:59.710 --> 38:01.510
and the Kuroda family's Sihe Ink

38:01.510 --> 38:03.920
are both Superior Grade One.

38:07.670 --> 38:09.360
After the painting test,

38:09.760 --> 38:11.620
the Li family's Liuhe Ink

38:11.480 --> 38:17.640
[Sihe Ink] [Literary Association]
[Liuhe Ink]

38:11.670 --> 38:13.320
and the Kuroda family's Sihe Ink

38:13.320 --> 38:15.550
are still both Superior Grade One!

38:16.360 --> 38:18.150
This is the 4th round of the competition,

38:18.150 --> 38:19.750
and there is still no winner.

38:19.960 --> 38:21.510
Are you confident this time?

38:21.510 --> 38:23.570
I witnessed Eighth Master Li and Zhen

38:23.590 --> 38:26.450
working together
making Liuhe Ink with my own eyes.

38:27.280 --> 38:29.410
Everyone made it with all their might.

38:29.800 --> 38:31.710
I believe we definitely won't lose.

38:31.710 --> 38:32.880
Your Highness,

38:33.110 --> 38:34.000
My Lords,

38:34.960 --> 38:37.550
and ink makers
of the Li family's Liuhe Ink.

38:37.960 --> 38:41.150
The Kuroda family's ink-making technique
originated in the Southern Tang Dynasty.

38:41.150 --> 38:43.400
We came here

38:43.480 --> 38:45.590
to learn from the famous

38:45.590 --> 38:46.710
Hui Ink of Ming.

38:47.110 --> 38:49.710
Unexpectedly, after 4 rounds
of competition,

38:49.800 --> 38:51.400
there is still no winner.

38:51.880 --> 38:55.070
This shows that our ink
is not inferior to Hui Ink.

38:55.510 --> 38:57.240
Your country has an old saying,

38:57.440 --> 38:59.840
"The latecomers surpass the old-timers."

38:59.960 --> 39:02.510
I suppose this is what it means.

39:04.070 --> 39:06.030
Please be patient, sirs.

39:06.320 --> 39:08.180
Our Ming also has another saying,

39:08.190 --> 39:10.850
"The truth is only revealed
at the last moment."

39:11.190 --> 39:12.920
The ink contest is not over yet.

39:13.070 --> 39:14.320
How can we jump

39:14.710 --> 39:16.110
to conclusions so early?

39:17.550 --> 39:19.030
After 4 rounds of competition,

39:19.030 --> 39:20.550
your dignified Liuhe Ink

39:20.760 --> 39:22.880
couldn't beat our Sihe Ink.

39:24.710 --> 39:25.840
Your Highness.

39:26.440 --> 39:29.040
The superiority and inferiority
between them

39:29.070 --> 39:29.960
surely

39:30.190 --> 39:32.280
need no further competition to be proven.

39:32.280 --> 39:34.230
Just as Li Zhen said,

39:34.590 --> 39:36.250
it is not until the last moment

39:36.880 --> 39:39.280
that we can easily judge which is better.

39:39.360 --> 39:41.030
Then, Your Highness,

39:41.070 --> 39:44.150
please give us a way
to distinguish the better one.

39:44.400 --> 39:47.230
You're giving me a hard time.

39:47.590 --> 39:48.710
Your Highness.

39:49.710 --> 39:50.670
I

39:51.320 --> 39:52.800
actually have a way.

39:53.760 --> 39:55.320
I once heard

39:55.840 --> 39:58.040
that Li Tinggui, the ancestor of Li Ink,

39:58.110 --> 40:01.800
made ink that was imperishable like jade.

40:02.190 --> 40:04.000
Once, a high-ranking official

40:04.030 --> 40:07.070
dropped a piece of Tinggui Ink
into a pond,

40:07.190 --> 40:10.150
and it was accidentally retrieved
a year later.

40:10.400 --> 40:12.060
Only then did people discover

40:12.510 --> 40:14.400
that the ink left underwater for a year

40:14.400 --> 40:17.630
was still as solid and bright as new.

40:17.960 --> 40:21.000
Since our Sihe Ink
and the Li family's Liuhe Ink

40:21.150 --> 40:23.190
both originated from Li Ink,

40:25.630 --> 40:28.630
I wonder if the Li family
dares to compete with us

40:29.150 --> 40:30.880
in a water test.

40:32.430 --> 40:33.280
Li Zhen.

40:34.670 --> 40:36.670
Do you dare to accept the challenge?

40:40.550 --> 40:41.760
Your Highness.

40:42.190 --> 40:43.030
The Li family

40:43.480 --> 40:45.110
is willing to compete
with the Kuroda family

40:45.110 --> 40:46.360
in a water test.

40:46.550 --> 40:47.990
If Li Ink loses—

40:48.230 --> 40:49.890
do you know the consequences?

40:50.110 --> 40:51.670
The ink made by Eighth Master Li,
the head

40:51.670 --> 40:55.030
of the Five Ink-making Grandmasters,
at the cost of his life,

40:55.030 --> 40:56.360
will never be defeated.

40:57.000 --> 41:00.320
As expected of an ink-making family
from a great nation,

41:01.320 --> 41:02.760
such noble bearing.

41:03.330 --> 41:05.850
In our previous competitions,

41:05.880 --> 41:07.360
there was no clear winner.

41:07.550 --> 41:09.000
So, Your Highness, I would like to ask you

41:09.000 --> 41:11.000
to add a reward to the competition.

41:11.300 --> 41:12.760
If the Kuroda family wins,

41:12.800 --> 41:16.110
please report this to the Ming Emperor

41:16.280 --> 41:17.710
and allow us to establish

41:17.840 --> 41:20.960
a trading house in Yue Port
in Zhangzhou of Great Ming.

41:21.400 --> 41:24.190
This will fulfill our wish to learn from

41:24.230 --> 41:26.690
and communicate
with the Ming ink industry.

41:33.800 --> 41:35.150
You don't even dare

41:35.230 --> 41:37.920
to agree to such a small request?

41:39.710 --> 41:40.960
Your Highness,

41:41.510 --> 41:44.230
both sides can ask for a reward.

41:44.510 --> 41:48.070
Since the Kuroda family has requested
a reward from Ming,

41:48.590 --> 41:49.920
if Li Ink wins,

41:50.000 --> 41:52.280
we should also request a reward

41:52.280 --> 41:53.880
from the Kuroda family.

41:55.150 --> 41:56.760
That makes sense.

41:56.920 --> 41:58.690
I heard that the Kuroda family's swords

41:58.690 --> 42:00.550
originated from our Tang swords.

42:01.000 --> 42:04.760
Although the Tang sword-making technique
has long been lost in Ming,

42:04.760 --> 42:08.510
it has been passed down
in the Kuroda family for centuries,

42:09.040 --> 42:12.000
becoming one of its most valued treasures.

42:12.670 --> 42:14.230
So, in this ink contest,

42:14.880 --> 42:16.400
if the Li family wins,

42:16.770 --> 42:19.420
I will ask you

42:19.710 --> 42:22.920
for the Kuroda family's
sword-making technique as the reward.

42:22.920 --> 42:26.510
This will fulfill our desire to learn from
and communicate with each other.

42:26.510 --> 42:30.030
What do you think?

42:31.510 --> 42:32.400
Well...

42:32.880 --> 42:33.680
What's wrong?

42:34.710 --> 42:36.360
You don't even dare

42:37.070 --> 42:40.630
to agree to such a small request?

42:49.190 --> 42:51.760
Let's do as you said.

42:52.190 --> 42:53.150
Good.

42:54.960 --> 42:56.030
Pass my order.

42:58.030 --> 42:59.710
Put the ink into the water.
